    "statusLabel": "REFERENCE ARCHITECTURE",
    "overviewSummary": "Two paths into one lakehouse. The streaming path takes device telemetry and clickstream events through Kinesis: raw records land in the bronze bucket while Spark cleans them into silver Delta tables and pushes live aggregates to ClickHouse. The batch ELT path syncs SaaS and database changes into bronze, and an Airflow schedule runs dbt every night to build the gold marts that dashboards query.",
